  "body": "The keeper house's existing east-gable triangle now uses the wall finish instead of roof shingles. The roof envelope, openings, all vertex attributes and the unpictured west end stay exact. This is a bounded T-2380 increment; the original compound picture match remains open/partial.\n\n### Evidence\n\nPinned Blender4.5.3 actually rebuilt272 frame-dwelling defaults before early checkpointc453:271 MASTERs were byte-identical and only the keeper received a genuine new WEB. Independent full-attribute triangle review proves exactly one material assignment changes. [Full native raw/source proof](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/49239fcd6898b180969e38651a677414274e7941/evidence/log-jail-2026-11-04/keeper-east-gable-native272-saved34a-quota-and-final-gaps/RECOVERY.md). Both fixed comparison records remain DIFFERS; the Gale end is nearly edge-on and Andreas is distant. ROADMAP/STATUS checkpoints preserve the archived history and current foreign notes.\n\n[Actual published6e23 BOTH review and missing desktop107](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/d7db87a72f5fd26048ab2cad5bea6fd6fe65d0f5/evidence/log-jail-2026-11-04/pr1702-published6e23-keeper-east-both-and-desktop107/RECOVERY.md): new east-face/body GPU presence and actual Inspect Design/Sources passed at1280\u00d7800 and390\u00d7780 in255.999s/227.676s. Root independently reviewed all six images and accepted the bounded wall boarding/loft continuity. The curated view is33\u201334feet up; phone rendering is soft; Sources frames show confidence groups, not fresh full-citation pixels. Old1683 keeper/source/camera/reader credit consumers are byte-exact across13 paths.\n\nThe missing published desktopStage3 passed107/0 in354.303s with zero page errors and proper process closure. Saved34a mobileStage3\u20134 really passed139/0 after the authenticated every-part official-publisher chain; it was not repeated. No desktopStage4/full15part claim. Native source1 derived-liberties RED/correction-without-rerun and source4 NumPy2.5 RED remain historical; the current hosted eight parts and aggregate pass on `ac68b544bd927ecf2aa70ac92492e5194ca14b37` rather than relabelling local results.\n\nCurrent dev includes qualified Sauganash stacks and Lake790+foldfee. This candidate preserves all272 real native frame inputs/bytes and current foreign outputs. Executed6e23 Jail records, sidecars, cameras, source credits, native assets and renderer logic carry exactly; release notes change separately, and three generated global tables carry only decoded Jail-row semantics through unchanged records/compiler code. No new browser execution onac68 is claimed.\n\nNo historical camera/grade promotion, passage clearance or full-compound match is claimed. No native rebuild/provider job was repeated. The local claim used a documented --force dead-own-run stale exception after auditing the stopped worker/no live jail PR; all feature pushes and this dev merge are ordinary, with no forcepush/admin bypass. Original T-2380 is released OPEN/partial after merge.\n",
